room test/chasm
# Tech 2's gap: 1664 u (52 tiles) from the near edge at 480 u to the far ledge at 2144 u, over a
# pit 192 u below the ledges (row 18): falling in is a hazard. The far ledge's face is smooth
# above the pit, and a pit has nothing to pogo off: nothing in the gap can be clung to, pogoed off
# or climbed (movement review 4, H1), and nothing can fall far and come back up on an Ember Toss's
# teleport (movement review 5, H1). Only a route that reaches the far ledge from the air crosses.
# tools/replay/gap_reach.gd measures every route on test/longchasm, this room's near half with no
# far side (tests/unit/tools/test_gap_reach_room.gd keeps the two the same).
size 80 20
spawn 300 384
tiles
################################################################################
